        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航你有没有觉得，最近AI圈的话题越来越\"哲学\"了？我今早看了几个新闻，越看越觉得不像科技版头条，倒像是哲学论文。",
      "start": 12.613,
      "duration": 10.101,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，你这个感觉我也有。今天OpenAI首席科学家Jakub Pachocki发了一篇长文反思AI对齐问题，标题就叫《An Alien Mind》，你听听这用词——异类思维。",
      "start": 23.167,
      "duration": 13.211,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，异类。我跟你说，这个词用得特别讲究。他没有说\"类人智能\"，也没有说\"超级智能\"，而是\"异类\"，意思是不再把AI看成人的延伸，而是看成一种完全不同的存在。",
      "start": 36.783,
      "duration": 17.129,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个定位的转变非常关键。传统的对齐研究，比如RLHF那一套，假设AI是可以被\"教化\"的，就像训练学生。但异类智能不一样，它的推理路径、价值判断、目标函数可能跟人类完全不在一个维度上。",
      "start": 54.345,
      "duration": 18.131,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太……那我们怎么跟一个完全\"异类\"的智能对齐啊？想想就有点头皮发麻。感觉像是跟外星人谈判，我们连对方的语言都听不懂。",
      "start": 72.941,
      "duration": 12.408,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，这就是Pachocki在文章里强调的——AI Alignment研究正式进入\"后超人智能\"时代。过去我们担心的是AI不够聪明，现在我们开始担心的是，AI聪明得让我们看不懂。",
      "start": 85.811,
      "duration": 13.472,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这跟咱们普通人有什么关系？说到底这种哲学命题是不是离生活太远了？",
      "start": 99.734,
      "duration": 5.442,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "关系大了。你想想，如果一个异类智能在帮我们做医疗诊断、做法律决策、做自动驾驶，它的判断逻辑跟我们完全不一样，那我们要不要相信它？这早就不是技术问题了，而是治理问题、哲学问题，甚至可以上升到社会契约的高度。",
      "start": 105.676,
      "duration": 16.041,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哇，这听起来像是科幻小说里的情节，但居然是OpenAI首席科学家在认真讨论的事情，太魔幻了。",
      "start": 122.155,
      "duration": 9.273,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且他文章里提了几个具体方向，比如要建立\"可解释性\"的强制标准，要让AI的决策过程对人类完全透明。还有\"价值多元性\"——不能把人类的单一价值观强加给AI，要承认不同文化、不同群体对\"对齐\"的理解可能完全不一样。",
      "start": 131.889,
      "duration": 18.653,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我觉得这点挺关键的。你注意啊，他其实是在说，人类自己要先想清楚\"人类到底想要什么\"，否则根本谈不上对齐。",
      "start": 150.987,
      "duration": 11.233,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你说到点子上了。说白了，对齐的前提是\"对齐的目标\"得先明确。但问题是，人类自己都没有一个统一的价值观，所以这事注定很难。好了，这个话题太深了，咱们换个节奏——对了，GPT-6这事儿你听说了吗？",
      "start": 162.694,
      "duration": 16.215,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "GPT-6？等等，我记得上一代不是GPT-5吗？怎么这次跳得这么快？",
      "start": 179.336,
      "duration": 5.965,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这你就out了吧，OpenAI这半年迭代节奏非常猛。GPT-6这次最大的看点不是参数规模又翻了多少倍，而是底层架构变了——循环Transformer正式亮相。",
      "start": 185.765,
