      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "循环Transformer？什么意思？Transformer怎么循环起来？",
      "start": 199.437,
      "duration": 5.616,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，传统Transformer是纯前馈的，信息从输入层到输出层单向流动，处理完就结束了。但循环Transformer引入了\"循环\"机制，让信息可以在不同层之间反复流动、迭代优化，相当于让模型\"多想几遍\"。",
      "start": 205.489,
      "duration": 18.74,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦我有点明白了。这就像什么？就像我们人类思考复杂问题的时候，会反反复复地想、来回地琢磨，而不是一句话说完就定了。AI现在也学会\"犹豫\"了。",
      "start": 224.646,
      "duration": 12.34,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比打得挺到位。技术上讲，这种架构能让模型在固定参数规模下获得更强的推理能力，尤其在数学证明、代码生成这种需要多步推理的任务上效果显著。",
      "start": 237.482,
      "duration": 12.756,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这跟咱们普通用户有什么关系？算力会不会爆？钱包会不会疼？",
      "start": 250.65,
      "duration": 6.356,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "不会，反而可能下降。问题是要继续走纯前馈Scaling的话，参数量会指数级增长，算力根本撑不住。循环架构本质上是\"用更少的参数做更多的事\"，理论上可以突破现有的算力瓶颈，这也是行业普遍押注它的原因。",
      "start": 257.485,
      "duration": 17.826,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "等等，那阿里是不是在这个方向上早就布局了？我记得之前看过相关报道。",
      "start": 275.743,
      "duration": 5.66,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这功课做得不错。阿里确实在循环Transformer上有积累，手握两篇顶会论文，他们的思路是\"循环+注意力\"混合架构，跟OpenAI的GPT-6路线不谋而合。说白了，这就是大模型架构范式的整体转向——从纯前馈Scaling正式迈入\"循环+注意力\"混合时代。",
